            "action_name": {
              "value": "Rage"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(concentrate, emotion, mental)\n\nRequirements: The monster hunter isn't fatigued or raging\n\nThe monster hunter gains 9 temporary Hit Points that last until the rage ends. While raging, they deal 8 additional damage with melee attacks, gain a +10-foot status bonus to their Speed, and take a \u20131 penalty to AC. The monster hunter can't use concentrate actions except Seek and rage actions. The rage lasts for 1 minute, until there are no enemies the monster hunter can perceive, or until the monster hunter falls unconscious. Once the rage ends, the monster hunter can't Rage again for 1 minute."
            },
